The directory modified/ contains 108 of the 2569 Lean files of the
repository-local import closure of the entry module above, as modified for this
project. Paths are relative to the upstream directory lean/. Every file in
modified/ differs from the upstream file of the same path; the upstream and
modified SHA-256 of every file of the closure are in overlay-manifest.json.

Kind of changes (stated in accordance with section 4(b) of the Apache License):

- 21 files: proof-internal refactors. Long proofs were split into private
  lemmas, or proof steps rearranged, so that each module compiles within the
  memory limit of the build. No exported statement was changed; the solver's final
  theorem was re-audited for axioms after the change. Diff:
  records/proof-only-changes.patch.
- 87 files: import-only edits. Aggregate Mathlib imports were replaced by
  focused imports, or missing imports added, with proof bodies unchanged. Diff:
  records/import-only-changes.patch.

The other 2461 files of the closure are used unmodified. They are not
redistributed here; scripts/fetch_openai_math.py downloads the commit above
from GitHub, checks every file against upstream-manifest.json and assembles the
compiled source tree (upstream files plus modified/), which it checks against
overlay-manifest.json.

The modifications were made in 2026 for the project "A subexponential algorithm
for the erasure logical error rate of sparse stabilizer codes" (Oliver D'Souza).
OpenAI is not responsible for them.
